  "content": "這是一個紅石輔助材質包，在不改變原版風格的情況下，對紅石資訊進行輔助顯示！\n我是材質包總監製！材質包是我找「希望」訂製的，主要貼圖是他完成， MCmoonRC 做了發射器與投擲器的貼圖\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/25de81aa57f64ac7f11dba258e537998b19caa81.png)\n------------------------------------------從側面區分黏性與普通活塞----------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/88fc5c99277aa297cf5b57ce093b931a937e0efa.png)\n------------------------------從任何角度都能區分發射器與投擲器，包括它們的朝向---------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/7bb06c7d93fbf016bfe077dbea514723d5667e71.png)\n---------------------------------------------從正上方區分漏斗朝向------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/a40bbb8294502f8b44c6462aaab9dc4aac6ac4a0.png)\n----------------------------------------從任何角度觀察偵測器的朝向----------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/2e7043c495ca114c1787b9f5c74f70d96ce9f15b.png)\n-----------------------------------------------紅石能量顯示------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/e0d93d65285b7962aca745975e19c4d84de19e86.png)\n----------------------------------------------注意這是6沒斷線----------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n![](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/S6XROiqp/images/39dc9c0a2b2b0faef082ccc3c5b497ab0e661b24.png)\n----------------------------------------------注意這是9有斷線----------------------------------------------------",
